# Whitelist: only send what cmd/hive/Dockerfile, cmd/hive/Dockerfile.test, and
# test/remote/Dockerfile need to the builder. The build context is the
# repository root.
*
!dist/hive_linux_*/hive
!dist/hive-drive-server_linux_*/hive-drive-server
